
>> blue := ['blue'].
>> colors := ሰልፍ ← ['yellow']; ['green']; blue ; ['red']; ['orange']; ['purple']; ['pink'].
>> palette := colors መነሻ: 2 ርዝመት: 3.
ውጤት ፃፍ: (palette አገናኝ: [',']), አዲስ-መስመር. 
